# Corpses of the Lost: "if YOU descended this turn" counts permanent cards put into Bot1's own graveyard only (CR 700.11).
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts it and then Hymn to Tourach on Bot2, whose hand is all Ornithopters: two permanent cards go to
# Bot2's graveyard, not Bot1's (Hymn itself is a sorcery). Bot1 has not descended, so nothing asks it to pay at the end
# step (the refusal; the Faithless Looting scenario is its positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Corpses of the Lost
Hymn to Tourach
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Corpses of the Lost.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hymn to Tourach.Cast(Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard = Hymn to Tourach
Bot1.Battlefield.Corpses of the Lost.Types = Enchantment
